# Effect variants (dclf-roadmap.md 4.1) under the registration census: Whiterun (mountain cloud cards and mist, turning), Riverwood
# (mist, river spray) and Dragonsreach (light beams) at 13:00, a census window (300 frames) in each after the load settles.
# Read "[DCLF] census class effect: effect-variant (...)" and "effect: effect-opaque" per window, against
# effect-variants-census-off.env (the two ported variants' switches at 0): cloud-lighting must be gone here, effect-opaque fewer.
# Also "[DCLF] effects (T7d's Effect port ...)" for members and failed pipelines. Shots must match the off run's.
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_CENSUS=1
CS_DCLF_STATS=1
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;700:coc Whiterun;1300:set timescale to 20;1310:fw 81a;1400:set timescale to 0;1401:set gamehour to 13;1500:dclf:mark=whiterun;2400:dclf:shot=ev-whiterun;2500:coc Riverwood;1801:fw 81a;3300:dclf:mark=riverwood;4200:dclf:shot=ev-riverwood;4300:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;5100:dclf:mark=dragonsreach;6000:dclf:shot=ev-dragonsreach
CS_DCLF_TEST_TURN=1500:2300:0.25
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=6100
